/E (mandatory front-of-pack health warnings, and other policies aimed at curbing the intake of sugary beverages. While Coca-Cola is responding proactively to this challenge, the execution risk remains significant. The company has invested heavily in reformulating its products to reduce sugar and has aggressively marketed its zero-sugar variants, most notably Coca-Cola Zero Sugar, which has been a major success. However, the core challenge persists: can the growth in these healthier alternatives expand quickly enough to fully offset any potential stagnation or decline in the highly profitable full-sugar brands that have long been the company's cash cow? If the pace of consumer and regulatory change outstrips Coca-Cola's ability to pivot its portfolio and its brand perception, it could lead to margin pressure and a long-term deceleration in its overall growth rate.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
