/E (Our financial analysis of Coca-Cola paints a picture of a mature, highly profitable, and exceptionally cash-generative enterprise. While top-line growth may be moderate, the company's ability to convert revenue into free cash flow is a central pillar of its investment appeal.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
